# Expo Mobile Starter — Core Rules

## 🚨 MANDATORY FIRST STEP 🚨

**READ THIS CHECKLIST BEFORE WRITING ANY CODE:**
→ @AGENT-CHECKLIST.md ← 

It tells you exactly which documentation to read based on your task.

---

This is a React Native + Expo app using Convex backend and Clerk auth.

## Tech Stack
- React Native + Expo Router
- Convex (backend + real-time database)
- Clerk (authentication)
- NativeWind (Tailwind for React Native)
- RN Reusables (shadcn/ui for React Native)
- Zustand (UI state)
- React Hook Form + Zod (forms)

## Architecture
- Frontend: Feature-based organization (features/{feature}/)
- Backend: Domain-based organization (convex/{domain}/)
- See @STRUCTURE_SUMMARY.md for complete structure

## Critical Rules
- File naming: kebab-case.tsx
- Functions: Regular functions (not arrow)
- Server state: Convex hooks (useQuery, useMutation)
- UI state: Zustand stores
- Never duplicate Convex data in local state
- Always use validators in Convex functions
- Components: React Native (View, Text, Pressable - not div, p, button)

